cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "CSUA-LDM: A Content-Style Disentangled Latent Diffusion Model With Uncertainty-Aware Guidance for Cross-Sensor Remote Sensing Image Super-Resolution"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  CSUA-LDM is a latent diffusion framework for cross-sensor remote sensing
  image super-resolution. A variational autoencoder disentangles each image
  into a content subspace that represents spatial structure and a style
  subspace that encodes sensor-specific spectral and radiometric
  characteristics. Conditional diffusion restores spatial details only in the
  content subspace, after which the reconstructed content is combined with a
  selected style representation during decoding to control the sensor style
  of the output image. The framework also estimates spatially resolved
  reconstruction uncertainty.
